	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Browse the arcourse graph from Alfred.

Keyword: arco — opens a window pinned to /root.

Each window lists one node's links. Type to filter them.
- Enter: open the link (node → arcourse web UI page; external → its URL)
- Shift+Enter: enter the link as a new node (a fresh window pinned to it)

Workflow variables:
- node: starting node path (default: /root)
- arco_bin: path to the arco binary (default: arco on PATH)
- web_base_url: arcourse server base URL (default: http://localhost:1183)</string>
